# Contributing to the list

Pull requests are welcome. Keep these rules:

- List only public repositories in the V-Sekai-fire organization. Put upstream projects that the organization forks in "Forks we maintain".
- Put each project in one section. Pick the section by subject, not by name prefix.
- Sort each section in alphabetical order.
- Use this format: `- [name](https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/name) - One sentence that says what it is. (Language)`
- Write the description as one plain sentence. Do not add speed, size or quality claims that have no benchmark.
- A project must have a free/libre licence.

If you do not use pull requests, open an issue.
